<title>FRANCE: Cetelem in one-for-one bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Cetelem in one-for-one bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>French consumer credit house Cetelem announced on Wednesday a one-for-one bonus issue as part of what it said was its ongoing drive to boost shareholder revenues.</p>
<p>&quot;This decision is part of the traditional distribution policy of Cetelem which aims to increase regularly the revenue of shareholders in maintaining at 10 francs the dividend per share on a growing number of shares,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
